name: bad_unreachable
description: >-
  An unconditional choice before the last one: the compiler reports "match
  creates unreachable outputs". The list still ends with an unconditional
  choice, so the restricted-profile check passes and the compiler's own
  check is what refuses it.
rule:
  match:
    - output: '["form_check"]'
    - condition: iteration == "commit"
      output: '["check_changed_only"]'
    - output: '["mass_check"]'
